----------------------------Description  of mineral phases --------------------------------------------------
     Mineral           concentration (Mol/l)           SI  
 Acetate-            @Acetate-.min()         
 Ca+2                @Ca+2.min()             
     Gypsum[s]            @Gypsum[s].con()  @evaluate:("if(@Gypsum[s].logact()^2>1e-20,@Gypsum[s].logact(),0) ") 
 H                   @H.min()                
 H2                  @H2.min()               
 H2O                 @H2O.min()              
     Gypsum[s]            @Gypsum[s].con()  @evaluate:("if(@Gypsum[s].logact()^2>1e-20,@Gypsum[s].logact(),0) ") 
 HCO3-               @HCO3-.min()            
 NH4+                @NH4+.min()             
 SO4-2               @SO4-2.min()            
     Gypsum[s]            @Gypsum[s].con()  @evaluate:("if(@Gypsum[s].logact()^2>1e-20,@Gypsum[s].logact(),0) ") 

