---------------------------- Description of tot phase --------------------------------------------------
 Acetate-                 @Acetate-.tot()         
     Acetate                   @Acetate.con()  @Acetate.logact()@evaluate:("10^@Acetate.logact()") 
 Ca+2                     @Ca+2.tot()             
     Ca                        @Ca.con()  @Ca.logact()@evaluate:("10^@Ca.logact()") 
 H                        @H.tot()                
     H[+1]                     @H[+1].con()  @H[+1].logact()@evaluate:("10^@H[+1].logact()") 
     S[-2]                     @S[-2].con()  @S[-2].logact()@evaluate:("10^@S[-2].logact()") 
